    "atlas_empty_title": "No matching region",
    "atlas_empty_hint": "Try a broader subject, purpose, or tool name.",
    "clear_search": "Clear search",
    "atlas_note": "Counts are entries in each catalog, and a few tools appear in more than one hub. STEAM Lab, SEL Hub, and Research Hub are read from the app’s own catalogs; the other hubs are hand-picked.",
    "privacy_saved_title": "Saved work",
    "privacy_saved_body": "Lessons, settings, and activities are saved in this browser on this device. Turning on cloud sync also saves them there. In Gemini Canvas or a private window, browser storage may not last, so download a project file to keep a copy.",
    "privacy_sessions_title": "Class sessions and submissions",
    "privacy_sessions_body": "Where session data goes depends on the connection you choose. Desktop LAN and local preview keep traffic on this computer or your local network. Bring-your-own Firebase uses your school’s or district’s own Firebase project. Class Mailbox sends packs and submissions through the teacher’s own Apps Script and keeps submissions in the teacher-owned Google Drive until the teacher deletes them. In Gemini Canvas, sessions use the storage Google provides to Canvas apps. A district server applies only if your district has set one up.",
    "privacy_ai_title": "AI",
    "privacy_ai_body": "Local AI engines run on this device once their models are downloaded. Hosted providers (Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, or a custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint) receive the prompt and only the text, images, or audio a feature needs, under that provider’s terms, retention, and age rules. Google’s Gemini API terms require users to be 18 or older, so student mode does not use a Gemini key pasted on this device, and students can use their own keys only after a teacher confirms they are adults.",
    "privacy_speech_title": "Speech and voices",
    "privacy_speech_body": "Speech to text: an on-device model, or the desktop app, keeps your voice on this device. The browser’s speech service may send your voice to the browser maker (in Chrome, Google); choose the engine in Speech setup. Read-aloud: on-device voices, such as the Kokoro voice pack, stay on this device, while some browser voices are online services.",
    "privacy_reports_title": "Problem reports",
    "privacy_reports_body": "A problem report is sent only when you choose to send it. The app removes keys and common personal details, such as email addresses and phone numbers, before sending. Reports go to AlloFlow’s private report inbox and are deleted after 30 days.",
    "privacy_paths_heading": "Where information can go",
    "privacy_choose_heading": "Choose the data path deliberately",
    "privacy_local_title": "For fully local operation",
    "privacy_local_body": "Choose a local AI engine, on-device speech, and a Desktop LAN or local-preview session. Finish model downloads before going offline, and leave web search, cloud sync, hosted media, and cloud AI off.",
    "privacy_hosted_title": "When using hosted services",
    "privacy_hosted_body": "Use an institution-approved account, endpoint, project, and data-processing agreement where required. A paid plan alone does not establish school approval or legal compliance.",
    "privacy_checklist_heading": "Before using student information",
    "privacy_check_1": "Open AI settings and identify the active provider and endpoint: local or hosted.",
    "privacy_check_2": "Open class-session settings and identify the transport, storage location, access controls, and deletion/retention process.",
    "privacy_check_3": "Open Speech setup and choose how speech becomes text.",
    "privacy_check_4": "Confirm institutional approval, provider age/use restrictions, and applicable agreements with your privacy or IT administrator.",
    "privacy_check_5": "Minimize names and other identifying details, then review generated output before sharing it.",
    "privacy_link_gemini_terms": "Gemini API terms",
    "privacy_link_gemini_edu": "Gemini for Education",
    "privacy_link_openai": "OpenAI API data controls",
    "privacy_link_anthropic": "Anthropic privacy center",
    "privacy_commitments_heading": "AlloFlow commitments",
    "privacy_commit_1": "AlloFlow does not sell data, show ads, or build advertising profiles, and it does not add advertising-analytics or profiling scripts.",
    "privacy_commit_2": "No separate AlloFlow username and password is required for core tools; an optional session transport may create temporary technical credentials.",
    "privacy_commit_3": "AlloFlow does not run a cloud service of its own for class sessions. Schools and districts that want one set up their own.",
    "privacy_commit_4": "The app’s files come from AlloFlow’s own site, and some exports load fonts from Google Fonts. As with any website, those servers see your device’s IP address.",
    "privacy_commit_5": "Third-party providers may keep operational or abuse-prevention logs under their own policies, so review the current terms for every service you enable.",
    "privacy_question_button": "Ask a privacy question or report a problem",
    "a11y_point_fonts": "Dyslexia-friendly & low-vision font options (OpenDyslexic, Atkinson Hyperlegible, Lexend)",
