    "tabletop_rule_field": "After exploring 2, 5, and 8 new spaces, choose how to use a chance encounter: collect a small supply bonus now or prepare a larger one for the next successful new investigation.",
    "field_review_phase": "An expedition encounter is ready. Choose supplies for now or prepare for the next investigation.",
    "chance_encounters_toggle": "Fortune dice, discovery cards, and expedition encounters",
    "chance_encounters_help": "Correct answers earn a d20 roll for bonus tokens or discoveries. Tabletop expeditions also offer themed encounters after 2, 5, and 8 new spaces: take supplies now or prepare a larger reward for your next successful investigation. Chance never removes resources.",
    "tactic_crew_included": "Includes the crew return after paying the full cost: {reward}",
