    "chance_crew_help": "Correct answers earn a d20 roll for bonus tokens or discoveries. Tabletop encounters after 2, 5, and 8 new spaces let you collect supplies, prepare an investigation, or reserve a crew reward for your next fully paid build. Chance never removes resources.",
    "field_plans_title": "Expedition plans",
    "field_crew_paid": "Construction crew paid off",
    "field_delivery_title": "Preparation paid off",
    "field_crew_delivery": "You paid the full cost of {name}. Your crew returned these supplies after construction.",
    "field_delivery_help": "Your next new investigation succeeded. These prepared supplies are now in your balance.",
    "field_preparation_title": "Prepared opportunity",
