        "my_safety_plan_stanley_brown": "📋 My safety plan (Stanley-Brown)",
        "best_built_with_a_counselor_or": "Best built WITH a counselor or therapist. ",
        "a_safety_plan_is_most_effective": "A safety plan is most effective when an adult who knows you helps you fill it in — they think of things you'd miss, and they're a person you've already practiced reaching out to. You can start it here, save it, and finish it together. Saved on this device only.",
        "filledcount_stepscount_filled": "{filledCount} / {STEPSCount} filled",
