        "when_to_use_which": "💡 When to use which: ",
        "box_breathing_4_4_4_4": "Box breathing (4-4-4-4) for general regulation — military and first responders use it. ",
        "4_7_8_for_falling_asleep": "4-7-8 for falling asleep or quick acute calm — the long exhale activates the parasympathetic system. ",
