        "grounding_5_4_3_2_1": "Grounding 5-4-3-2-1",
        "when_your_mind_is_racing_or": "When your mind is racing or anxiety is climbing, the 5-4-3-2-1 technique pulls attention back to the body and the present moment. Use any of the 5 senses, even if some aren't accessible — name what you remember, what you imagine, what you wish you smelled. It still works.",
