        "a_quick_way_to_track_how": "A quick way to track how you're feeling over time. Rate your distress 0–10. Add an optional note. The pattern over a week tells you something words alone won't. ",
        "if_your_reading_is_8_or": "If your reading is 8 or above for more than an hour, please reach out to a trusted adult or text HOME to 741741.",
