        "you_re_in_real_distress_the": "You're in real distress. The Breath pacer (one section up) and Grounding 5-4-3-2-1 are both right here. ",
        "if_thoughts_of_self_harm_are": "If thoughts of self-harm are present, text HOME to 741741 (Crisis Text Line) or call/text 988 right now.",
