        "worth_pausing_for_try_the_breath": "Worth pausing for. Try the Breath pacer or Grounding tool. If this level keeps coming back, telling a trusted adult is a good move.",
        "your_pattern": "📊 Your pattern",
        "7_day_avg_avg_sevendayreadingscount_readings": "7-day avg: {avg} · {sevenDayReadingsCount} readings",
        "distress_over_time_chart": "Distress over time chart",
