        "a_note_on_practice": "A note on practice: ",
        "real_conversations_are_messier_than_scripted": "Real conversations are messier than scripted scenarios. The point of practice isn't to memorize lines — it's to develop the INSTINCT to ask, listen, stay, and tell. With practice, that instinct gets faster.",
