      "strat_grief_fresh_crisisEscalation": "If grief includes suicidal thoughts ('I want to go with them'): 988 immediately. Grief deserves support.",
      "strat_grief_fresh_shortDesc": "New loss: hours, days, weeks old; shock, numbness, waves of crying, disorientation, time distortion.",
